Sometimes when you have several extra statuses, some of them may get cut
off, so you won't see them.  This patch adds the same statuses in the
control-x attributes -window.

Statuses shown are: encumbrance and hunger, confusion, food poison and
illness, blind, stun, hallu and sliming.


